                <invention-title lang="de">VERABREICHUNG EINER MEHRSCHICHTIGEN DIGITALEN THERAPIE AN BENUTZER ZUR BEHANDLUNG VON FUNKTIONSBEEINTRÄCHTIGUNG</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">ADMINISTRATION D'UNE THÉRAPIE NUMÉRIQUE MULTICOUCHE À DES UTILISATEURS POUR TRAITER UNE DÉFICIENCE FONCTIONNELLE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">DELIVERY OF MULTI-LAYER DIGITAL THERAPY TO USERS FOR ADDRESSING FUNCTIONAL IMPAIRMENT</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Provided herein are systems and methods for presenting interactive sessions to address functional impairment in users related to a disease or disorder. A computing device may provide a first session for a cognitive training layer associated with a skill. The computing system may provide a second session for a virtual functional training layer for the user to apply the skill in virtual settings. The computing system may provide a third session for a functional training layer for the user to perform an activity to apply the skill. The efficacy of the medication that the user is taking to address the disease or disorder may be increased.</p>
            </abstract>
